EN:
I think taking {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}medicine{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} has helped.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}As long as I stay home and rest,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
I'm sure I'll get better soon.

DE:
