EN:
I WAS feeling horrible,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} but I'm
starting to feel a little better now.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}It's all thanks to the {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}medicine{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} gave me.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Per fortuna {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}ho preso la {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}medicina{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
